# What the CHUTEXC deployment does not serve.
#
# chutexc.vercel.app is the statewide projections site. The Tualatin roster
# dashboard is a different product for a different audience - one school, 749
# named local athletes - and it gets its own Vercel project rather than a path
# on this one. Strangers come to chutexc for the odds and should not be one
# guessed URL away from a page about somebody's kid.
#
# So tualatin/ is excluded here and is the ROOT DIRECTORY of a second Vercel
# project, which serves it at tualatinxctf.vercel.app with its own
# tualatin/vercel.json carrying its own headers. That project cannot see
# anything above its root, so the seed, the archive and the backtest are all
# out of its reach by construction rather than by a rule somebody has to keep
# maintaining.
#
# Both projects must keep framework preset "Other". See CLAUDE.md.
tualatin/
pull/roster/
